<% frontend = ENV["FRONTEND_URL"].presence || "http://localhost:5173" %>
<% reset_url = "#{frontend}/reset-password?reset_password_token=#{@token}" %>
Hi <%= @resource.username.presence || "there" %>,

We got a request to reset your K-pop Universe password. Open the link below to choose a new one. This link expires in a few hours.

<%= reset_url %>

If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password won't change.

— K-pop Universe
